@startuml
title CPSAction Entity Model

class CPSAction {
  **Primary Key**
  --
  + ID : ObjectID
  --
  **Action Identification**
  --
  + ActionCode : string
  + UniqueId : string
  + RequestAction : string
  + ActionType : string
  + ActionStatus : string
  --
  **Maker Information**
  --
  + MakerID : string
  + MakerName : string
  + MakerPhoneNumber : string
  + Department : string
  + MakerActionTime : time.Time
  --
  **Checker Information**
  --
  + CheckerID : string
  + CheckerName : string
  + CheckerPhoneNumber : string
  + CheckerActionTime : *time.Time
  --
  **Action Data**
  --
  + PreviousAction : interface{}
  + CurrentAction : interface{}
  + RejectionReason : string
  --
  **Metadata**
  --
  + IsDeleted : bool
  + CreatedAt : time.Time
  + LastModifiedAt : time.Time
}

note right of CPSAction::ActionStatus
  **Possible Values:**
  - PENDING
  - APPROVED
  - REJECTED
end note

note right of CPSAction::ActionType
  **Possible Values:**
  - CREATE
  - UPDATE
  - DELETE
  - ENABLE
  - DISABLE
end note

note right of CPSAction::RequestAction
  **150+ Actions Including:**
  - CREATE_BANK
  - UPDATE_USER
  - ENABLE_WALLET
  - CREATE_DONATION
  - etc.
end note

note bottom of CPSAction
  **Field Descriptions:**
  
  **ID**: MongoDB unique identifier
  **ActionCode**: Auto-generated unique code
  **UniqueId**: Additional identifier
  **MakerID**: User ID of action initiator
  **CheckerID**: User ID of approver/rejector
  **Department**: Maker's department
  **RejectionReason**: Reason if rejected
  **PreviousAction**: Original data (for UPDATE)
  **CurrentAction**: New data to apply
  **ActionStatus**: PENDING/APPROVED/REJECTED
  **ActionType**: CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE/ENABLE/DISABLE
  **RequestAction**: Specific action (e.g., CREATE_BANK)
  **CreatedAt**: Action creation timestamp
  **CheckerActionTime**: Approval/rejection timestamp
end note

@enduml
